        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## Observability Stack Monitoring\n\n**Note**: Container-level metrics for Prometheus, Grafana, and OpenTelemetry Collector are not currently exposed.\n\nTo enable monitoring of these components:\n\n### Option 1: Use Docker cAdvisor\n```yaml\ncadvisor:\n  image: gcr.io/cadvisor/cadvisor:latest\n  container_name: cadvisor\n  ports:\n    - 8080:8080\n  volumes:\n    - /:/rootfs:ro\n    - /var/run:/var/run:ro\n    - /sys:/sys:ro\n    - /var/lib/docker/:/var/lib/docker:ro\n  command:\n    - '--docker_only=true'\n```\n\nThen configure Prometheus to scrape cAdvisor:\n```yaml\nscrape_configs:\n  - job_name: 'cadvisor'\n    static_configs:\n      - targets: ['cadvisor:8080']\n```\n\n### Option 2: Enable Prometheus Self-Monitoring\nPrometheus already exposes its own metrics at `http://prometheus:9090/metrics`\n\nAdd to prometheus.yml:\n```yaml\nscrape_configs:\n  - job_name: 'prometheus'\n    static_configs:\n      - targets: ['localhost:9090']\n```\n\n### Option 3: OTEL Collector Self-Telemetry\nAdd to otel-collector-config.yaml:\n```yaml\nservice:\n  telemetry:\n    metrics:\n      address: \":8888\"\n```\n\nThen add scrape config for OTEL metrics endpoint.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to Enable Observability Stack Monitoring",
